                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Beautiful girls in a mostly very wholesome story, with MANY different scenes to play out and a lot of different endings as well. Sometimes there's little mistakes, like a white bra being called a black one, or a swimsuit being called a bikini, but it's rare. In the case of a threesome (or even harem) playing out though, I found it a bit lazy that every single girl had the exact same body, just the hair being different in those pictures. That's the extent of my complaints though, I liked to see all aspects of this story (and the sexy girls, of course), and had fun playing the game. The writing feels real and the artwork is great.",
